  "description": ".NET for Android / .NET MAUI bindings for the native Datadog Android SDK's dd-sdk-android-core module: SDK initialization, configuration, tracking consent, user and account info, batching and upload. Built against dd-sdk-android 3.12.1. Every feature module needs this one. Enable a feature by also referencing DatadogNet.RUM.Android, DatadogNet.Logs.Android, DatadogNet.Trace.Android or DatadogNet.SessionReplay.Android.",
